DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ppoowweerrmmaacc__nnvvrraamm driver provides access to the Open Firmware configura‐
     tion NVRAM available on the Apple PowerPC-based machines.

     This driver currently supports "Core99" machines containing a Sharp, Mi‐
     cron, or AMD NVRAM.

